window.AUDIO_CLIPS = {"TOEIC Speaking Test.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Begin preparing now.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Begin reading aloud now.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Begin speaking now.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "This is the end of the test.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Questions one and two. Read a text aloud. In this part of the test, you will read aloud the text on the screen. You will have 45 seconds to prepare. Then you will have 45 seconds to read the text aloud.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Questions three and four. Describe a picture. In this part of the test, you will describe the picture on your screen in as much detail as you can. You will have 45 seconds to prepare your response. Then you will have 30 seconds to speak about the picture.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Questions five through seven. Respond to questions. In this part of the test, you will answer three questions. You will have three seconds to prepare after you hear each question. You will have 15 seconds to respond to Questions 5 and 6, and 30 seconds to respond to Question 7.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Questions eight through ten. Respond to questions using information provided. In this part of the test, you will answer three questions based on the information provided. You will have 45 seconds to read the information before the questions begin. You will have three seconds to prepare after you hear each question. You will have 15 seconds to respond to Questions 8 and 9, and 30 seconds to respond to Question 10. Question 10 will be asked twice.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Question eleven. Express an opinion. In this part of the test, you will give your opinion about a specific topic. Be sure to say as much as you can in the time allowed. You will have 45 seconds to prepare. Then you will have 60 seconds to speak.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Imagine that a Canadian marketing firm is doing research in your country. You have agreed to participate in a telephone interview about public transportation.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "How often do you use public transportation, and where do you usually go?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "How long does it usually take you to get to work or school, and how do you get there?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What is one thing that could be improved about public transportation in your area? Why?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Hi, this is Mark. I'm planning to attend the business leaders conference, but I lost my copy of the schedule. I hope you can answer a few questions for me.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Where is the conference being held, and what time does it start?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I heard that lunch costs extra. Is that right?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Could you tell me about all the sessions that Daniel Moore is leading?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Do you agree or disagree with the following statement? \"It is better for employees to work from home than at the office.\" Use specific reasons and examples to support your opinion.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Imagine that a friend from another country is going to visit your city. You are having a telephone conversation about restaurants.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What kind of food is popular in your city, and how often do you eat it?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "How far in advance should I make a reservation at a popular restaurant in your city?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Can you recommend a restaurant for me to visit? Why do you recommend it?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Hi, this is Laura from the HR department. I'll be interviewing applicants on Thursday, but I don't have the schedule with me. Could you help me with some information?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What time does the first interview start, and where will the interviews take place?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I heard that I'm interviewing an accountant at three o'clock. Is that correct?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Could you tell me about the applicants for the sales manager position?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Some people think that university students should have a part-time job. Others think that students should focus only on their studies. Which view do you agree with, and why? Use specific reasons and examples to support your opinion.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Imagine that a US marketing firm is doing research in your country. You have agreed to participate in a telephone interview about hair salons.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "When was the last time you got a haircut, and where did you go?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "How do you usually find out about a new hair salon?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What is the most important thing to you when you choose a hair salon? Why?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Hello, I'm interested in taking a cooking class at the community center this spring. I have a few questions.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "When does the spring session start, and when does it end?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I heard that I need to bring my own ingredients. Is that right?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I'm only free on Saturdays. Could you tell me about the classes offered on Saturdays?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Do you agree or disagree with the following statement? \"It is important to try new foods when you travel to another country.\" Use specific reasons and examples to support your opinion.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Imagine that you are talking on the telephone with a friend. You are talking about spending time outdoors.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "How often do you go to a park, and who do you usually go with?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What do you usually do when you go to a park?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "If a new park opened in your neighborhood, what kind of facilities would you want it to have? Why?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Hi, this is Jason. I'm leaving for my business trip next week, but I can't find my itinerary. Could you answer a few questions for me?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What time does my train leave on Monday, and what time does it arrive?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I'll be staying at the Oceanview Hotel, right?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Could you tell me what I'll be doing on Tuesday?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which is better for a company: hiring experienced workers or hiring new graduates and training them? Use specific reasons and examples to support your opinion.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Imagine that a British marketing firm is doing research in your country. You have agreed to participate in a telephone interview about buying fruit and vegetables.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Where do you usually buy fruit and vegetables, and why do you shop there?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "How often do you buy fresh fruit, and what kind do you usually buy?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Do you think it is better to buy vegetables at a traditional market or at a large supermarket? Why?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Hello, this is Tom. I'm a new lab assistant, and I'm going to attend the safety training on Thursday. Could I ask you a few questions?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Where is the training, and what time does it start?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I need to bring my own safety glasses, right?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Could you tell me about the sessions that Dr. Peter Wong is leading?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Do you agree or disagree with the following statement? \"Children should learn how to cook at school.\" Use specific reasons and examples to support your opinion.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Imagine that a Canadian marketing firm is doing research in your country. You have agreed to participate in a telephone interview about bicycles.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "When was the last time you rode a bicycle, and where did you ride it?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Would you rather ride a bicycle alone or with friends? Why?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Do you think your city is a good place for riding bicycles? Why or why not?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Hi, this is Kevin. I'm starting work at Nova Software next week, and I'd like to check some details about the orientation.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What day is the orientation, and where will it be held?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I heard there's a question-and-answer session with the CEO on Monday afternoon. Is that correct?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Could you tell me about the sessions led by Brian Hall?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Some people prefer to work in an open office where everyone shares one space. Others prefer to work in a private office. Which do you prefer, and why? Use specific reasons and examples to support your opinion.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Imagine that an Australian marketing firm is doing research in your country. You have agreed to participate in a telephone interview about parties and celebrations.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "When was the last time you went to a party, and what was the occasion?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Do you prefer having parties at home or at a restaurant? Why?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "If you were planning a birthday party for a friend, what kind of food would you serve? Why?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Hi, my name is Sarah. I'm planning to go to the summer festival with my family. Could you give me some information?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What date is the festival, and where will it be held?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I heard that I have to buy a ticket to get in. Is that true?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Could you tell me about the events that will take place on the main stage?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Do you agree or disagree with the following statement? \"It is better to eat lunch with coworkers than to eat alone.\" Use specific reasons and examples to support your opinion.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Imagine that a travel magazine is doing research in your country. You have agreed to participate in a telephone interview about hotels.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "When was the last time you stayed at a hotel, and where was it?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "How do you usually book a hotel room?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "When you choose a hotel, which is the most important to you: price, location, or service? Why?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Hi, this is Linda from the events office. I'm out of the office today, so I don't have the reservation list for Friday. Could you check a few things for me?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which room is the sales training in, and what time does it start?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The retirement party is in the Sky Lounge, isn't it?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Could you tell me about the events that will take place in the evening?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Some people prefer to travel with a tour group. Others prefer to plan their own trips. Which do you prefer, and why? Use specific reasons and examples to support your opinion.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Imagine that a US marketing firm is doing research in your country. You have agreed to participate in a telephone interview about libraries.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "How often do you go to a library, and what do you usually do there?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Do you prefer reading paper books or electronic books? Why?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What would make you want to visit a library more often? Why?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Hi, I'm calling about the library's events this month. I saw a poster, but I didn't write down the details.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "When is the author talk, and where will it be held?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I heard that I need to pay to attend the events. Is that right?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Could you tell me about the events that require registration?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Do you agree or disagree with the following statement? \"Because of the Internet, public libraries are less important today than they were in the past.\" Use specific reasons and examples to support your opinion.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Imagine that a friend is moving to your neighborhood. You are having a telephone conversation about grocery shopping.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Where is the nearest grocery store from your home, and how do you get there?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What time of day is best to go grocery shopping in your neighborhood?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Do you think it is a good idea to buy groceries online? Why or why not?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,"};
